{"ID":"20240205164749-k7j26vd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205164749-k7j26vd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164749-k7j26vd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095926-75er6x7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614094119-f01s6rj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704081806-5k424bd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"359补02诃黎勒（诃梨勒、诃子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828114247"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095926-75er6x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095926-75er6x7","updated":"20240206095935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t果实呈卵形或椭圆形，长2.4cm，直径22.5cm。表面棕褐色，略具光泽，有56条纵菱形及不规则的皱纹，在纵棱线之间有12条明显或不明显的纵凸起，可见细密横向纹理，基部有圆形果柄痕。质坚实，剖开后，果肉厚24mm，黄棕色或黄褐色。果核长l.52.5cm，浅黄色，粗糙，坚硬、种子一粒，狭长纺锤形，长约1cm，直径24mm，膜质种皮黄棕色，子叶2，白色，相互重叠卷旋。无臭，味酸涩而后甜。\n【性味】\t苦、酸、涩，平。\n【功效】\t敛肺；涩肠；下气；利咽，清凉解毒。主治久泻；久痢；脱肛；喘咳痰嗽；久咳失音。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095927-n40havu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095927-n40havu","updated":"20240206095927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095927-t2fe610.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165241-w7ap5t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165241-w7ap5t5","updated":"20240205165241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃子-20240205165241-r8lbq67.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704081307-7ckxw9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704081307-7ckxw9z","updated":"20240704082908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 462px;","style":"width: 452px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒2-20240704081616-gfgp72i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 452px;\" parent-style=\"width: 462px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704082900-qqinnzy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒-20240704081503-24jtsej.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828114244-ykrl2vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828114244-ykrl2vg","updated":"20240828114247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 560px;","style":"width: 550px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704082823-hbkc350.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 550px;\" parent-style=\"width: 560px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 294px;","style":"width: 284px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒4-20240704082407-1gicibt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 284px;\" parent-style=\"width: 294px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 347px;","style":"width: 337px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒8-20240704083036-o6foh16.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 337px;\" parent-style=\"width: 347px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828114244-89tmghj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828114244-89tmghj","updated":"20240828114244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒9-20240704083128-on6gwtn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 782px;","style":"width: 772px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒3-20240704082042-e2m3c5w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 772px;\" parent-style=\"width: 782px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704082729-en8u2lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704082729-en8u2lx","updated":"20240704082741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 644px;","style":"width: 634px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704081536-l5329l6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 634px;\" parent-style=\"width: 644px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 620px;","style":"width: 610px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒6-20240704082729-aolj2nj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 610px;\" parent-style=\"width: 620px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704084742-w57khnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704084742-w57khnb","updated":"20240704084742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 487px;","style":"width: 477px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704084559-abi3yvi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 477px;\" parent-style=\"width: 487px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 776px;","style":"width: 766px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"诃黎勒10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/诃黎勒10-20240704084731-f5x9nu4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 766px;\" parent-style=\"width: 776px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704081806-5k424bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704081806-5k424bd","updated":"20240704084258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 639px;","style":"width: 629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704081806-kvz1vgj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 629px;\" parent-style=\"width: 639px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704084258-v1sganf.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240614094524-vx6lrdl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094524-vx6lrdl"}},{"ID":"20240614094547-8r7qyuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094547-8r7qyuf","updated":"20240614094550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094547-0lpe8cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094547-0lpe8cv","updated":"20240614094547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名诃子．涩肠敛肺、泻气．"}]},{"ID":"20240614094547-h7z98tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094547-h7z98tg","updated":"20240614094547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦温以泄气消痰．（海鱼放涎凝滑、船不能行、投诃子汤、寻化为水、化痰可知．）酸涩以敛肺收脱．除胀满．下食积．利咽喉．通津液．开音止渴．治冷气腹胀．膈气呕逆．痰嗽喘急．泻痢脱肛．肠风崩带．（同乌梅、倍子则收敛、同陈皮、浓朴则下气、得人参治肺虚寒嗽、得陈皮、砂仁治冷气腹胀、佐白术、莲子治虚寒久泻、佐樗皮治肠 便血、同蛇床、五味、山茱、续断、杜仲治虚寒带下．）嗽痢初起者勿服．虽酸涩．却又泄气．气虚者亦忌．性温．若肺有实热．泻痢因湿热．气喘因火冲者．法咸禁之．（丹溪以为降火、殊为不然、东垣以为嗽药中不可用、亦属偏见．）从番舶来．岭南亦有．六棱黑色、肉浓者良．酒蒸一伏时．去核焙．生用清金行气．熟用温胃固肠．核、止咳及痢．"}]},{"ID":"20240614094524-9nj87bp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094524-9nj87bp"}},{"ID":"20240614094537-9ukhh8t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-9ukhh8t","updated":"20240614094541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃子《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094537-t6x3zpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-t6x3zpn","updated":"20240614094537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涩肠，敛肺，泻气"}]},{"ID":"20240614094537-bzqlbz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-bzqlbz3","updated":"20240614094537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦以泄气消痰，酸以敛肺降火（东垣曰∶肺苦气上逆，急食苦以泄之，以酸补之。诃子苦重泄气，酸轻不能补肺，故嗽药中不用），涩以收脱止泻，温以开胃调中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094537-qjwy2bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-qjwy2bc","updated":"20240614094537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治冷气腹胀，膈气呕逆，痰嗽喘急（肺挟痰水，或被火伤，故宜苦酸以敛之），泻痢脱肛，肠风崩带（皆取其酸涩），开音止渴（肺敛则音开，火降则渴止。古方有诃子清音汤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094537-cn2klu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-cn2klu1","updated":"20240614094537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然苦多酸少，虽涩肠而泄气，气虚及嗽痢初起者，忌服（同乌梅、倍子，则收敛；同陈皮、浓朴，则下气。得人参，治肺虚寒嗽；得陈皮、砂仁，治冷气腹胀。佐白术、莲子，治虚寒久泻；佐樗皮，治肠癖便血。同蛇床、五味、山茱、续断、杜仲，治虚寒带下）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094537-5q7ylem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094537-5q7ylem","updated":"20240614094537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从番舶来，番名诃黎勒。岭南亦有。六棱黑色，肉浓者良。酒蒸一伏时，去核取肉用，用肉则去核。生用清金行气，煨熟温胃固肠（海鱼放涎凝滑，船不能行，投诃子汤，寻化为水，其化痰可知）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094524-250divk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094524-250divk"}},{"ID":"20240614094525-h2g30gf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094525-h2g30gf","updated":"20240614094529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094525-wgpwjbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094525-wgpwjbo","updated":"20240614094525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，无毒。主冷气，心腹胀满，下食，生交、爱州。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-klr1330","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-klr1330"}},{"ID":"20240614094455-xqx1zqe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094455-xqx1zqe","updated":"20240614094508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094455-fdfa5yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094455-fdfa5yy","updated":"20240614094455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气虚人亦宜，缓缓煨熟，少服。此物虽涩肠，而又泄气，盖其味苦涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094513-xwah26p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094513-xwah26p"}},{"ID":"20240614094514-3w9lcqc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-3w9lcqc","updated":"20240614094518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-xq5erxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-xq5erxp","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。消痰。下气。化食。开胃。除烦。调中。止渴。降火。破胸膈结气。通利精液。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-2sge91t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-2sge91t","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止肠久泄。赤白痢。呕吐。霍乱。心腹虚痛。奔豚。肾气。肠风泻血。妇人崩中带下。漏胎。胎动欲产。诃子丸。诃子皮川姜肉豆蔻龙骨木香赤石脂附子各等分。研末。米糊丸梧子大。每服四十丸。治脾胃不和。泄泻不止。又方。诃子五钱。椿根白皮二两。母丁香三十粒。研末。醋煮米糊丸梧子大。每服五十丸。日三次。治休息痢昼夜无度。脐腹撮痛。诸药不效者。又方。诃黎勒皮三分。肉豆蔻一枚。青黛麝香芦荟朱砂熊胆各一分。研末。酒煮粳米饭为丸黍米大。每服三丸。日二次。治食疳。量儿大小加减。又方。诃子皮五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-d9ukym4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-d9ukym4","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海蛤粉青黛香附（童便制）杏仁贝母栝蒌仁各二钱五分。研末。姜汁和蜜丸樱桃大。每服一丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-lpf8dcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-lpf8dcb","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"噙化。治劳嗽。诃子散。诃子（炮）炙草浓朴干姜（炮）神曲（炒）草果高良姜（炒）麦芽（炒）白茯苓陈皮各等分。研末。每服二三钱。水煎。入盐少许服。治霍乱吐利。九种心痛。及心脾冷痛不可忍。又方。诃子二枚。降香青黛各一钱。五倍子五钱。研末。先用葱盐汤洗净。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-t6okj47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-t6okj47","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剪去指甲。用药末敷。或麻油调涂。治嵌甲流脓。又方。诃黎勒皮陈皮各一两。半夏人参桂心白术细辛当归（炒）炙草各五钱。藿香赤茯苓川芎各七钱五分。咀。每服五钱。加生姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094514-vlue6gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094514-vlue6gq","updated":"20240614094514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水煎服。治妇人血风气攻脾胃呕逆。不纳饮食。又方。诃黎勒皮赤茯苓各二两。槟榔当归（炒）大黄（炒）各一两。吴茱萸木香各五钱。咀。每服三钱。加生姜三片。水煎服。治劳嗽上气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094347-40refge","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094347-40refge"}},{"ID":"20240614094447-qf8siol","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094447-qf8siol","updated":"20240614094451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094447-nxpt5wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094447-nxpt5wy","updated":"20240614094447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即诃子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094447-tjr85xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094447-tjr85xl","updated":"20240614094447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦涩温无毒。六棱者佳，去核用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094447-igu15nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094447-igu15nv","updated":"20240614094447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃子苦涩降敛。生用清金止嗽，煨熟固脾止泻。古方取苦以化痰涎，涩以固滑泄也。殊不知降敛之性，虽云涩能固脱，终非甘温益脾之比。昔人言，同乌梅、五倍则收敛，同橘皮、浓朴则下气，同人参则补肺治嗽。东垣言嗽药不用者，非也。然此仅可施之于久嗽喘乏，真气未艾者，庶有劫截之能。又久嗽阴火上炎，久痢虚热下迫，愈劫愈滞，岂特风寒暴嗽、湿热下痢为禁剂乎？曷观世医用润肺丸、益黄散之功过可知。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094418-59srvr3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094418-59srvr3"}},{"ID":"20240614094439-rzb2vf0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-rzb2vf0","updated":"20240614094442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-hfuqk0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-hfuqk0z","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名诃子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-kk6dvrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-kk6dvrl","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、酸、温。入手太阴、阳明经。敛肺降火。止胎漏，疗崩带。治肾气奔豚，止痰嗽喘急，收泻血脱肛，去心腹胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-7vrt82n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-7vrt82n","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得橘皮、浓朴，泄气。配乌梅、五味子，敛血。佐肉果，止水泻。佐白术，浓肠胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-lwfbs61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-lwfbs61","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六路纹者良，或多或少，便是他种。酒蒸去核取肉用。清金行气，生用。温胃固肠，煨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-subec3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-subec3h","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元气虚陷者，当避其苦降之性。嗽痢初起，肺与大肠实热，俱禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-jz663mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-jz663mr","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"皮"}]},{"ID":"20240614094439-ahdsrn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094439-ahdsrn5","updated":"20240614094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消腹中之恶物。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094418-dm8vyj7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094418-dm8vyj7"}},{"ID":"20240614094428-ii7y7d3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094428-ii7y7d3","updated":"20240614094433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094428-67zag97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094428-67zag97","updated":"20240614094428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，无毒。主冷气，心腹胀满，下食。萧炳云∶下宿物，止肠癖久泄，赤白《药性论》云∶使。能通利津液，主破胸膈结气，止水道，黑须发。日华子云∶消痰，除烦，治水，调中，止泻痢，霍乱，奔豚肾气，肺气喘急，消食开胃，肠风泻血，崩五膈气，怀孕未足月人漏胎及胎动欲生，胀闷气喘，并患痢人后分急痛，并产后阴烧熏，及热煎汤熏，通手后洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094418-dr3qmg6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094418-dr3qmg6"}},{"ID":"20240614094419-ve6mq0x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094419-ve6mq0x","updated":"20240614094424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094419-0ru99hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094419-0ru99hu","updated":"20240614094419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094419-2qlf15z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094419-2qlf15z","updated":"20240614094419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸、微苦，气涩，入手阳明大肠、手太阴肺经。收庚金而住泄，敛辛金而止咳，破壅满而下冲逆，疏郁塞而收脱陷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094419-dxhmmad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094419-dxhmmad","updated":"20240614094419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃黎勒散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"诃黎勒十枚，为散，粥饮和，顿服。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治气利。以肝脾郁陷，二气凝塞，木郁风动，疏泄失藏，而为下利。利则气阻而痛涩，是为气利。诃黎勒行结滞而收滑脱也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094419-7nh92yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094419-7nh92yo","updated":"20240614094419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠陷而为利者，清气滞塞而不收也，肺逆而为咳者，浊气壅塞而不敛也。诃黎勒苦善泻而酸善收，苦以破其壅滞，使上无所格而下无所碍，酸以益其收敛，使逆者自降而陷者自升，是以咳利俱止也。其治胸满心痛，气喘痰阻者，皆破壅降逆之力，其治崩中带下，便血堕胎者，皆疏郁升陷之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094347-8vx8csp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094347-8vx8csp"}},{"ID":"20240614094410-ehay3l9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-ehay3l9","updated":"20240614094413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094410-nipd39l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-nipd39l","updated":"20240614094410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即诃子。味苦酸涩。性温。无毒。降也。阴也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094410-56xhgg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-56xhgg7","updated":"20240614094410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主冷气。心腹胀满。下食。（开宝）破胸膈结气。通利津液。（甄权）下宿物。止腹虚痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094410-zd31005","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-zd31005","updated":"20240614094410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之。及煎【归经】入肺大肠二经。为收敛之品。（生用清金保肺行气煨用固气实肠温胃）【前论】寇氏曰。气虚人宜缓缓少用。以此虽涩肠。而又泄气也。庵曰。肺敛则音开。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094410-smeq3lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-smeq3lz","updated":"20240614094410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗽【禁忌】经疏曰。凡气虚嗽。痢初起者。均忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094410-owv161y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094410-owv161y","updated":"20240614094410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】雷公曰。凡使。以六棱黑色肉浓者良。酒浸。蒸去核。取肉用。用核不用肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094348-z14huib","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094348-z14huib"}},{"ID":"20240614094358-u21on2j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094358-u21on2j","updated":"20240614094403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094358-q3h1zw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094358-q3h1zw4","updated":"20240614094358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒苦温能开，酸涩能收。开则化痰涎，消胀满，下宿食，发音声；收则止喘息，已泻痢。然苦多酸少，虽涩肠而终泄气，古方用是物皆极有斟酌。仲圣诃黎勒散治气利。气利者，气与矢俱失也，必有痰涎阻于肠中。诃黎勒既涩肠而又化痰涎，最于是证相得。又以粥饮和服，安其中气。是诃黎勒之泄，亦有功无过矣。千金诃黎勒丸治气满闭塞，不能食喘息。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094358-a72kec3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094358-a72kec3","updated":"20240614094358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不岂能即返，诃黎勒能一物而两治之。两治之物，无冲和之性，蜜丸又所以和之也。与仲圣用诃黎勒之意正复无异。若诃子清音汤治中风不语，是但用其泄矣；协以甘桔，则不至过泄而音可开。真人养脏汤治久痢脱肛，是但用其涩矣；协以参术归芍诸药，则不至徒涩而痢可止肛可收。凡此皆用药之权衡，不可不知者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094348-xb4f7kp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094348-xb4f7kp"}},{"ID":"20240614094349-goqhvhd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094349-goqhvhd","updated":"20240614094353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃梨勒《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094349-1xr8623","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094349-1xr8623","updated":"20240614094349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃梨勒温通肺津，泻逆消痰敛咳频，开胃涩肠消食胀，肾积胎漏崩带神。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094349-j9wlinx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094349-j9wlinx","updated":"20240614094349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梵语云诃梨勒，俗名诃子。味苦，微酸。无毒。沉而降，阴也。苦多酸少，能泻肺敛肺而不能补。故但通利津液，泻气上逆，胸膈结满，消痰除烦。治久咳、火伤肺郁、胀满、喘嗽，开胃调中，涩肠脏，止水道、久痢、气痢、久泻肛痛、霍乱，消食下气，除冷气心腹胀满。又治奔豚肾气，胎漏胎动，气喘胀闷，产后阴痛，和蜡烧熏及煎汤熏洗。一切崩中带下，肠风泻血并治，盖有收涩降火之功也。气实者最效，气虚及暴嗽初泻不可轻用。六棱黑色肉浓者良。水泡，面包煨熟，去核，或酒浸蒸去核，焙干。子未熟时风飘堕者，谓之随风子，曝干收之。治痰嗽咽喉不利，含三数枚，殊胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-j3kt8ir","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-j3kt8ir"}},{"ID":"20240614094337-l30rhxp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-l30rhxp","updated":"20240614094341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-g359pyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-g359pyc","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即诃子出波斯。今岭南广州亦有之。其木作实似栀子橄榄状。七八月成熟。实棱只具六路。或多或少者非。肉浓者佳。曝干收之。益小为胜。毗黎勒个个毗头。一种勒圆而文露。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-5qcsone","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-5qcsone","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或八路至十二三路。号榔精勒。味涩不堪。为害殊甚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-3o4uejy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-3o4uejy","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味涩而苦。微酸有甘。气温味浓。苦重。阴也。降也。入肺大肠二经。主治冷气心腹胀满。消痰。（海舶遇大鱼放涎滑。数里船不能通。乃煮此洗其涎滑。寻化为水。其消痰功力可知。）下气。疗上气喘急。破胸膈结气。敛肺止久嗽。利咽喉。通津液。疗肾气奔豚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-gx7p4h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-gx7p4h3","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及大便不通。实大肠。止肠癖久泄。并患痢人肛门急痛。产妇阴痛。（和蜡烧烟熏之。或煎汤熏洗。）肺苦气上逆。急食苦以泄之。以酸补之。诃子苦重泻气。酸轻不能补肺。（东垣）味苦而性急。肺苦急。急食苦以泻之。谓降而下走也。故诃子下气。惟气实者宜之。气虚似难轻服。（丹溪）气虚人宜缓缓煨熟少服。兹物苦涩。虽涩肠。又泻肺气故耳。（宗）同乌梅五倍子用。则收敛。同橘皮浓朴用。则下气。同人参用。则能补肺。治咳嗽。但咳未久者。不可骤用。同人参肉豆蔻。则实大肠。得人参。治肺虚受寒喘嗽。得陈皮砂仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-i5a33fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-i5a33fh","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主冷气入内。心腹胀满。及因寒食不下。得益智。止虚寒小水不禁。佐樗根白皮。止肠癖泻血。佐白术莲实。止久泻因于虚寒。同蛇床五味山萸杜仲续断。止虚寒带下。劳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-uxbqrsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-uxbqrsc","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（即火郁嗽）肺气因火伤极。遂郁遏胀满。不得眠一边。用诃子海浮石瓜蒌杏仁青黛童便浸香附半夏曲等。姜蜜调噙化服。此证必以补阴为主。而取诃味酸苦。有收敛降火之功。下痢赤白久不瘥。转为白脓。用诃子三枚。两炮一生。并取皮末之。以沸浆水一合服之效。若只水痢。加甘草末一钱匕。若微有脓血。加三匕。血多亦加三匕。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-ftrlwhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-ftrlwhy","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕诃子产于炎土。七八月结实。禀金气以告成。而金随从火以为用。故其味初尝之涩。次苦。苦居胜。又次酸。酸微有甘。夫苦从火化。酸者阳气之不尽宣。而涩乃阴气之不尽畅也。昔贤谓血得酸则敛。得苦则涩。是阴持于阳之中不能尽畅而为涩也。诃子之先涩者金。次苦者火。禀金气而反从火以为用。故其金从火以降。而火又由金以敛。所以同于降泻。则奏降泻之功。同于收敛。则致收敛之效。大约具降收之全性。与他药之擅一长者有异也。方书于诃子有止用皮者。有止用肉者。其肉先涩次苦。而涩不敌苦。又次酸及甘。乃甚微。是肉之为用。降泻居多。而泻中犹有收义。更合于中土之气而不尽泻也。其皮涩与苦等。次止有甘。亦甚微。是皮之涩能敌苦。泻犹未极。又止带甘。则泻中尤有缓也。二者须索其味之有异以施治。乃为得之。再按诃子下逆气。泻结气。通积聚。利咽喉。历考成方。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-31imch9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-31imch9","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如息贲之枳实散。伏梁之半夏散。奔豚之木香槟榔散。便闭之七宣丸。又声喑之诃子汤。梅核气之清咽屑。或止同于降泻。从邪之实者论治。或更同于寒凉之降泻。从实邪之有热者论治也。又如胸痞气滞胁肋刺痛之沉香升降散。胸痹喘息之利膈散。息贲之半夏汤。喘证之苏杏散。或兼补剂。从虚中有实者论治。或更兼温补。从虚中有寒者论治也。是其降泻为功。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-kgpm0gy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-kgpm0gy","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岂得畏气虚而不用乎。至又有用其酸与涩者。义固非与降泻相戾也。人身肺气犹天。其职司降。而有降即有收。自飞门至于魄门。皆一气之所贯。（若有降无收。有收无降。则升降息而气立孤危矣。）经故曰魄门亦为五脏使。言脏腑糟粕。固由其泻。而脏气升降。亦借以调。诃子入手太阴阳明。其味始于涩苦。终于酸甘。降与收随所合而为用。是以丹溪治久嗽劫剂。则同于百药煎荆芥穗。河间治失音发声。则同于桔梗木通童便。东垣以止久痢。则同于御米壳干姜陈皮。宝鉴则合于椿白皮母丁香。其通便闭也。合杏仁麻仁枳壳为二仁丸。协柴胡枳实桃仁大黄木香为七宣丸。绎此不可以识诃子之长技。亦惟我所使欤。总之。用以降泻。宜于气实。实者邪气实。用以收涩。则宜于气虚。虚者正气虚。此中后先主辅。惟当适事为故耳。至缪氏致慎于火嗽湿热痢。立论良是。第丹溪治火嗽久病。有同杏仁青黛海粉皂角胆星而用者。又治湿热久痢。（地榆丸）有同地榆当归木香黄连阿胶乌梅而用者。正可推此类以尽变也。又如滑泻之治。有诃子散以治热。更有诃子丸以治寒。举寒热而皆宜。其故可思矣。再河间治热滑诃子散。用诃子木香黄连甘草。其云腹痛渐止。泻下渐少。宜此药止之。如止之不已。宜因其归而送之。加浓朴一两。竭其邪气也。玩此。则主辅应有合宜之味。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094337-p8v3ati","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094337-p8v3ati","updated":"20240614094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而火嗽凡咳嗽因于肺有实热滞下。湿热正盛。法并忌之。（仲淳）〔修事〕水泡。面包煨熟去核。或酒浸蒸去核。焙干。清痰生用。止泻煨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-2ccx2od","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-2ccx2od"}},{"ID":"20240614094323-z5zzz1i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-z5zzz1i","updated":"20240614094330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094323-we19u4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-we19u4e","updated":"20240614094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（唐本草）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094323-4hyvvgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-4hyvvgs","updated":"20240614094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦温，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094323-9vxa8e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-9vxa8e3","updated":"20240614094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主冷气心腹胀满，下食。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094323-6zzceea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-6zzceea","updated":"20240614094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出波斯，今岭南、广州亦有之。本似木 ，开白花。作实似卮子、橄榄状，色青黄，皮与肉相着。七八月成熟，具六路，肉浓者佳。修事，勿用毗黎勒，个个毗头者是也。若诃黎勒实，棱只有六路。或多或少者，并是杂路勒，圆而文露，或八路，至十二、三路，号榔精勒，涩不堪用，为害殊甚也。凡使酒浸六时，蒸六时，刀削去路，用肉则去核，用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094323-a2h7usp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094323-a2h7usp","updated":"20240614094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶诃，谴也；黎，众也；勒坚柔难断也。味大苦，气大温，对待冷气在心腹，致胀满食卒不得下，变生肠 喘急，肠风崩带，奔豚霍乱，痰涎胶固，坚柔难断者，谴之断之，少阳胆腑决断药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-gq66pg2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-gq66pg2"}},{"ID":"20240614094311-kp48rje","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-kp48rje","updated":"20240614094316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃梨勒《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-tfey996","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-tfey996","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，无毒。主冷气，心腹胀满，下食。生交、爱州。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-07hupb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-07hupb6","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶树似木 （音患），花白。子形似栀子，青黄色，皮肉相着。水摩或散服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-dzezsgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-dzezsgy","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（唐本先附）臣禹锡等谨按萧炳云∶诃梨勒，苦、酸。下宿物，止肠 久泄，赤白痢。波斯舶上来者，六路，黑色，肉浓者良。药性论云∶诃梨勒，使，亦可单用，味苦、甘。能通利津液，主破胸膈结气，止水道，黑髭发。日华子云∶消痰下气，除烦治水，调中，止泻痢，霍乱，贲豚肾气，肺气喘急，消食开胃，肠风泻血，崩中带下，五膈气，怀孕未足月人漏胎，及胎动欲生，胀闷气喘。并患痢人后分急痛，并产后阴痛，和蜡烧熏及热煎汤熏，通手后洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-ndyrwda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-ndyrwda","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶诃梨勒，生交、爱州，今岭南皆有，而广州最盛。株似木 ，花白。子似栀子，青黄有四、五十株，子极小而味不涩，皆是六路。每岁州贡，只以此寺者。寺有古井，木根蘸水，水味不咸。每子熟时，有佳客至，则院僧煎汤以延之。其法用新摘诃子五枚，甘草一寸，皆碎破，汲木下井水同煎，色若新茶。今其寺谓之干明，旧木犹有六、七株。古井亦在。南海风俗尚贵此汤，然煎之不必尽如昔时之法也。诃梨勒主痢，《本经》不载。张仲景治气痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-86ruze0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-86ruze0","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以诃梨勒十枚，面裹 灰火中煨之，令面黄熟，去核细研为末，和粥饮顿服。又，长服方∶诃梨勒、陈桔皮、浓朴各三大两，捣筛蜜丸，大如梧子。每服二十丸至三十丸。唐·刘禹锡《传信方》云∶予曾苦赤白下，诸药服遍久不瘥，转为白脓。令狐将军传此法∶用诃梨勒三枚上好者，两枚炮取皮，一枚生取皮，同末之，以沸浆水一两合服之，淡水亦得。若空水痢，加一钱匕甘草末；若微有脓血加二匕；若血多加三匕，皆效。又取其核，入白蜜研，注目中，治风赤涩痛，神良。其子未熟时，风飘堕者，谓之随风子，曝干收之。彼人尤珍贵，益小者益佳。治痰嗽，咽喉不利。含三数枚，殊胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-wjtz09n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-wjtz09n","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海药∶云按徐表《南州记》云∶生南海诸国。味酸、涩，温，无毒。主五鬲气结，心腹虚痛，赤白诸痢，及呕吐，咳嗽。并宜使皮其主嗽，肉炙治眼涩痛。方家使陆路诃梨勒，即六棱是也。按波斯将诃梨勒、大腹等，舶上，用防不虞。或遇大鱼放涎滑水中数里，不通舡也，遂水，可量治气功力者乎。大腹、诃子性焦者是近铛下。故中国种不生，故梵云诃梨恒鸡，谓唐言天堂未并只此也。雷公云∶凡使，勿用毗梨勒、庵梨勒、榔精勒、杂路勒，若诃梨勒纹只有六路。或多或少，并是杂路勒，毗路勒个个毗，杂路勒皆圆露，纹或八露至十三路，号曰榔痉。或多或少，并是杂路勒，毗路勒个个毗，杂路勒皆圆露，纹或八露至十三路，号曰榔精勒，多涩，不入用。凡修事，先于酒内浸，然后蒸一伏时。其诃梨勒，以刀削路，细锉焙干用之。外台秘要∶治一切风痰，风霍乱，食不消，大便涩。诃梨三枚，捣取皮。和酒顿服，三、五度良。又方∶治风热冲项热闷。诃梨一枚以大者，芒硝，同于醋中，搅令消，摩敷热处。经验方∶治嗽气嗽久者亦主之。生诃梨一枚，含之咽汁。瘥后口爽，不知食味，却煎槟榔汤一碗服之，立便有味。此知连州银坑官成密方。广济方∶治呕逆不能人∶治常患气。以诃梨三枚，湿纸裹煨，纸干即剥去核，细嚼。以生乳一升，下之，日三服。又方∶治一切气，宿食不消。诃梨一枚，入夜含之，至明嚼咽。集验方∶蜀沙门传水痢。以诃梨勒三颗，面裹炮赤去面，取诃梨勒皮捣为末，饭和为丸。米饮空腹下三七丸，已百人见效。子母秘录∶治小儿霍乱。诃梨一枚，末。沸汤研一半，顿服，未瘥再服。食医心镜下气消食。并茶曲尘色，着少盐服。广异记云∶高仙芝，大食得诃梨勒，长五寸，初置抹肚中，便觉腹中痛，因大利十余行，初为诃梨为祟。待欲弃之。后问大食长老。云∶此物人带一切病消，利者出恶物耳。仙芝甚保，天宝末被诛，遂失所在。金光明经流水长者子除病品云∶热病下药，服诃梨勒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094311-nt0epjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094311-nt0epjt","updated":"20240614094311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶诃梨勒，气虚人亦宜。缓缓煨熟，少服。此物虽涩肠，而又泄气，盖其味苦涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-au9733s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-au9733s"}},{"ID":"20240614094258-jvyxavy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-jvyxavy","updated":"20240614094301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-x2qjp9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-x2qjp9i","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」诃子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-9s5ww9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-9s5ww9l","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」苦、温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-8rjqr0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-8rjqr0v","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-028qhyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-028qhyq","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、下气消食。用诃子一枚，研为末，另以水一升，在瓦器中煎开几次后下药，再煎开几次，加盐少许饮服。又方：夜含诃子一个，天明时嚼咽。又方：用诃子三枚，包湿纸中煨熟。去核细嚼，牛乳送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-uxrphud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-uxrphud","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、久咳。用生诃子一枚，含口内咽汗。咳止后，口味很差，不想吃东西，可煎槟榔汤一碗服下，立即开味。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-7frfvx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-7frfvx1","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、呕逆不食。用诃子皮二两，炒过，研为末，加糊做成丸子，如梧子在，每服二十丸，空心服，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-q1tlte8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-q1tlte8","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小儿风疾闭，语音不畅，气促喘闷啤足动摇。用诃子（半生半炮，去核）、大腹皮等分，水煎服。此方名“二圣散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-ocz4qre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-ocz4qre","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、气痢水泻。用诃子十枚，面裹煨熟，去核，研为末，一次服完，稀饭送下。加饭调药末和成丸子服亦可。方中也有加入木香的。又方：用诃子、陈桔皮、厚朴各三两，捣碎，筛过，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大，每服二、三十丸，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-6uyyp00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-6uyyp00","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、赤白痢。用诃子十二个，六个生用，六个煨熟，去核焙干，研为末。赤痢用生甘草汤下，白痢用炙甘草汤下。不止，再服药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094258-6rktaks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094258-6rktaks","updated":"20240614094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、男子下疳。用大诃子烧灰，加入麝香少许，先以淘米水洗患处再搽药，或以荆芥、黄蘖、甘草、马鞭草、葱白煎汤洗亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-l05tl34","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-l05tl34"}},{"ID":"20240614094248-eiuaz7w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-eiuaz7w","updated":"20240614094252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃黎勒《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094248-jz1dpjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-jz1dpjm","updated":"20240614094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，味苦。苦而酸，性平，味浓，阴也，降也。苦重酸轻。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094248-0zs1osp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-0zs1osp","updated":"20240614094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《象》云∶主腹胀满，不下饮食；消痰下气，通利津液，破胸膈结气；治久痢赤白，肠风。去核，捣细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094248-4gx2mz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-4gx2mz8","updated":"20240614094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《心》云∶经曰肺苦气上逆，急食苦以泄之，以酸补之。苦重泻气，酸轻不能补肺，故嗽药中不用。俗名诃子、随风子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094248-u67raq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-u67raq2","updated":"20240614094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主冷气，心腹满，下食。仲景治气痢，以诃黎勒十枚，面裹， 灰火中煨之。令面黄熟，去核，细研为末，和粥饮顿服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094248-pg5pjt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094248-pg5pjt0","updated":"20240614094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《衍义》云∶气虚人亦宜缓缓煨熟，少服。此物能涩肠而又泄气，盖其味苦涩故尔。其子未熟时，风飘堕者，谓之随风子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-g10bba2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-g10bba2"}},{"ID":"20240614094135-9eiqz1q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094135-9eiqz1q","updated":"20240614094215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃梨勒《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094130-efnj76a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094130-efnj76a","updated":"20240614094130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诃梨勒温通肺津，泻逆消痰敛咳频，开胃涩肠消食胀，肾积胎漏崩带神。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094130-pdkopz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094130-pdkopz4","updated":"20240614094130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梵语云诃梨勒，俗名诃子。味苦，微酸。无毒。沉而降，阴也。苦多酸少，能泻肺敛肺而不能补。故但通利津液，泻气上逆，胸膈结满，消痰除烦。治久咳、火伤肺郁、胀满、喘嗽，开胃调中，涩肠脏，止水道、久痢、气痢、久泻肛痛、霍乱，消食下气，除冷气心腹胀满。又治奔豚肾气，胎漏胎动，气喘胀闷，产后阴痛，和蜡烧熏及煎汤熏洗。一切崩中带下，肠风泻血并治，盖有收涩降火之功也。气实者最效，气虚及暴嗽初泻不可轻用。六棱黑色肉浓者良。水泡，面包煨熟，去核，或酒浸蒸去核，焙干。子未熟时风飘堕者，谓之随风子，曝干收之。治痰嗽咽喉不利，含三数枚，殊胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094116-s7lt9xj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094116-s7lt9xj"}},{"ID":"20240614094117-m2zp2ry","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-m2zp2ry","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：诃子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-2eclxdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-2eclxdr","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sadsvwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sadsvwi","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hē Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-iao03ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-iao03ng","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-9owyvfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-9owyvfw","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 诃黎勒"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-js9p76d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-js9p76d","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-tryksx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-tryksx9","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" FRUCTUS CHEBULAE"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vk46wkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vk46wkt","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vtebq8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vtebq8r","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为使君子科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Terminalia chebula Retz. 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"绒毛诃子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Terminalia chebula Retz. var. tomentella Kurt. 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋、冬二季果实成熟时采收，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-z5yy0qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-z5yy0qz","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-teulpv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-teulpv6","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为长圆形或卵圆形，长2～4cm，直径2～2.5cm。表面黄棕色或暗棕色，略具光泽，有5～6条纵棱线及不规则的皱纹，基部有圆形果梗痕。质坚实。果肉厚0.2～0.4cm，黄棕色或黄褐色。果核长1.5～2.5cm，直径1～1.5cm，浅黄色，粗糙，坚硬。种子狭长纺锤形，长约1cm,直径0.2～0.4cm；种皮黄棕色，子叶2，白色，相互重叠卷旋。无臭，味酸涩后甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-m35habc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-m35habc","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vfhzkmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vfhzkmr","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-z4nkss7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-z4nkss7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-lze3cas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-lze3cas","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：除去杂质，洗净，干燥。用时打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-5e5bhn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-5e5bhn8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃子肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取净诃子，稍浸，闷润，去核，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-6ahe4b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-6ahe4b0","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-u0qjfde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-u0qjfde","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品去核粉末3g，加乙醇10ml，超声处理20分钟，上清液作为供试品溶液。另取没食子酸对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含0.5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各3μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿-醋酸乙酯-甲酸（6：4：1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以2％三氯化铁乙醇溶液。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-aiqmzdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-aiqmzdn","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-dwxszjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-dwxszjh","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-z2uj2tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-z2uj2tt","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ldywk0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ldywk0y","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、酸、涩，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xwq9goa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xwq9goa","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-uhpewp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-uhpewp8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 涩肠敛肺，降火利咽。用于久泻久痢，便血脱肛，肺虚喘咳，久嗽不止，咽痛音哑。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-tpmge64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-tpmge64","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ibktzqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ibktzqz","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gl44ooi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gl44ooi","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-3idfnrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-3idfnrz","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-du0ey8n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-du0ey8n","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：诃子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4ggf630","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4ggf630","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-k2blsf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-k2blsf6","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hē Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-a52llwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-a52llwq","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vu792m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vu792m8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 诃黎勒（《金匮要略》），诃黎（《千金方》），随风子（刘禹锡《传信方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-7mlr4v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-7mlr4v2","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-5cbg3si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-5cbg3si","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-p35bkt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-p35bkt7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-3sy5lgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-3sy5lgn","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为使君子科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"诃子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋末冬初果实成熟时采摘，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gs7xlzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gs7xlzp","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ln0l51u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ln0l51u","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多栽于路旁或村落附近。原产印度、缅甸等处。我国西藏、云南、广东、广西等地均有分布。主产云南，广东、广西等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-dv3gn3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-dv3gn3q","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-0uudqnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-0uudqnq","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大乔木，高达20～30米。叶互生或近对生，卵形或椭圆形，长7～25厘米，宽3～15厘米，先端短尖，基部钝或圆，全缘，两面均秃净，幼时叶背薄被微毛；叶柄粗壮，长1.5～2厘米，有时于顶端有2个腺体。穗状花序生于枝顶或叶腋，花两性，黄色；萼杯状，长约3毫米，先端5裂，裂片三角形，先端尖锐，内面被毛；花瓣缺；雄蕊10，着生于萼管上，花药黄色，心脏形；子房下位，1室，胚珠2枚，花柱长突出。核果倒卵形或椭圆形，长2.5～4.5厘米，幼时绿色，热时黄褐色，表面光滑，干时有5棱。种子1颗。花期6～8月。果期8～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xkwej8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xkwej8v","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-jdyrfnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-jdyrfnd","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥果实呈卵形或近圆球形，长3.5厘米，径1.5～2厘米。表面黄绿色或灰棕色，微带光泽，有5条纵棱及多数纵皱纹，并有细密的横向纹理，基部有一圆形的果柄残痕。质坚实，断面灰黄色，显沙性，陈久则呈灰棕色。内有黄白色坚硬的核，钝圆形。核壳厚，砸碎后，里有白色细小的种仁。气微，味酸涩。以黄棕色、有光泽，坚实者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nwu4kix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nwu4kix","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-2naderp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-2naderp","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 果实含鞣质23.60～37.36％，其成分为诃子酸、诃黎勒酸、1，3，6-三没食子酰葡萄糖及1，2，3，4，6-五没食子酰葡萄糖、鞣云实精、原诃子酸、葡萄糖没食子鞣甙、并没食子酸及没食子酸等。又含莽草酸、去氢莽草酸、奎宁酸、阿拉伯糖、果糖、葡萄糖、蔗糖、鼠李糖和氨基酸。还含番泻甙A、诃子素、鞣酸酶、多酚氧化酶、过氧化物酶、抗坏血酸氧化酶等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-knue3gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-knue3gu","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树皮含β-谷甾醇、鞣质、并没食子酸、没食子酸和焦性儿茶酚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-n5ztqbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-n5ztqbg","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-x4uay5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-x4uay5e","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①一般药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ddmcmq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ddmcmq3","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"果实含鞣质较多，有鞣质的一般作用（见\"五倍子\"条），如收敛、止泻等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-5lyznjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-5lyznjo","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②抗菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-zvv29r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-zvv29r8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体外试验证明，对4～5种痢疾杆菌都有效，尤以诃子壳为佳。诃子水煎剂（100％）除对各种痢疾杆菌有效外，且对绿脓杆菌、白喉杆菌作用较强，对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌、肺炎球菌、溶血性链球菌、变形杆菌、鼠伤寒杆菌亦有作用（纸片法）；对痢疾杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌的有效浓度分别为1：32，1：128，1：64（试管法）。诃子在体外有良好的抗伤寒杆菌的作用，用盐酸、乙醚提取的乙醇提取物具有更高的抗菌及抗真菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-358ly4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-358ly4q","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③其他作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ccjmrw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ccjmrw7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从干果中用80％乙醇提得的诃子素，对平滑肌有罂粟碱样的解痉作用；除鞣质外还含有致泻成分，故与大黄相似，先致泻而后收敛。含诃子的中药复方曾报告有某些抗癌效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-iqmf8lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-iqmf8lb","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同属植物Terminalia belenica的果实的醇提取物有促进胆汁分泌、降压、抑制平滑肌的作用。其种子仁中所含之油与蓖麻油相似，对小鼠有泻下作用，水解产物（与蓖麻油相似）也有刺激作用，毒性不大。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-khfmme8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-khfmme8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-dcmnjov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-dcmnjov","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 诃子肉：用锤打开诃子果皮，除去果核即得。炒诃子：清水洗净，晒干，入锅内用武火炒至表面深黄色为度，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-pi1b9tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-pi1b9tk","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡修事诃黎勒，先于酒内浸，然后蒸一伏时，其诃黎勒以刀削路，细锉，焙干用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-i08r1vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-i08r1vz","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草述钩元》：\"诃黎勒，水泡，面包煨热去核，或酒浸蒸，去核，焙干。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gq1l5jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gq1l5jx","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-lyp1d9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-lyp1d9q","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肺、胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-0ztnx7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-0ztnx7x","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、肝、脾、肾、大肠五经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-cskpcb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-cskpcb4","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"入大肠、胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-7lrlrlx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-7lrlrlx","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-0yim3t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-0yim3t5","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦酸涩，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ezsvch6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ezsvch6","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"味苦甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-w4krwqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-w4krwqs","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"味苦，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-i3malit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-i3malit","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《海药本草》：\"味酸涩，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-2ifwxgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-2ifwxgf","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vtz1u3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vtz1u3b","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凡外邪未解，内有湿热火邪者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nr5heej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nr5heej","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"气虚人忌多服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-yp1hou3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-yp1hou3","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医学入门》：\"气虚及暴嗽、初泻，不可轻用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-06vnxs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-06vnxs7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"咳嗽因于肺有实热，泄泻因于湿热所致，气喘因于火热冲上，带下因于虚热而不因于虚寒，及肠辩初发，湿热正盛，小便不禁因于肾家虚火，法并忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-h0lwf0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-h0lwf0s","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求真》：\"虚大不宜独用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-cdvprks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-cdvprks","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ktd557p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ktd557p","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 敛肺，涩肠，下气。治久咳失音，久泻，久痢，脱肛，便血，崩漏，带下，遗精，尿频。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-aki6q6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-aki6q6i","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《南方草木状》：\"可作饮，变白髭发令黑。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gxhl1ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gxhl1ys","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"通利津液，主破胸脯结气，止水道，黑髭发。’"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-qhqn96x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-qhqn96x","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"主冷气心腹胀满，下宿物。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-6fvk7k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-6fvk7k7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《海药本草》：\"主五膈气结，心腹虚痛，赤白诸痢及呕吐咳嗽，并宜使皮，其主嗽。肉炙治眼涩痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-qf9xii8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-qf9xii8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"消痰，下气，除烦，治水，调中，止泻痢，霍乱，奔豚肾气，肺气喘急，消食开胃，肠风泻血，崩中带下，五膈气，怀孕未足月漏胎及胎动欲生，胀闷气喘。并患痢人后分急痛产后阴痛，和蜡烧熏及热煎汤熏洗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-pl4sr13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-pl4sr13","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草图经》：\"治痰嗽咽喉不利，含三数枚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-szplp5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-szplp5l","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草通玄》：\"生用则能清金行气，煨用则能暖胃固肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-9wvqpl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-9wvqpl0","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4lqrn1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4lqrn1l","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sbrllvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sbrllvy","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gjzll7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gjzll7w","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治久咳语声不出：诃子（去核）一两，杏仁（泡，去皮、尖）一两，通草二钱五分。上细切，每服四钱，水一盏，煨生姜切五片，煎至八分，去滓，食后温服。（《济生方》诃子饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-97jnlh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-97jnlh6","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治嗽，气嗽久者亦主之：生诃黎一枚，含之咽汁。瘥后口爽不知食味，却煎槟榔汤一碗服之。（《经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-39ftrj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-39ftrj8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治失音，不能言语者：诃子四个（半炮半生），桔梗一两（半炙半生），甘草二两（半炙半生）。上为细末，每服二钱，用童子小便一盏，同水一盏，煎至五七沸，温服。（《宣明论方》诃子汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nxli5h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nxli5h5","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治结膜炎：诃子、栀子、楝子各等量。共研细末，每次二钱，水煎服，每日服三次。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-3dw5y09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-3dw5y09","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治老人久泻不止：诃黎勒三分（煨，用皮），白矾一两（烧灰）。上药捣细罗为散。每服不计时候，以粥饮调下二钱。（《圣惠方》诃黎勒散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ib2f44l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ib2f44l","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治气利：诃黎勒十枚（煨），为散，粥饮和，顿服。（《金匮要略》诃黎勒散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-fhlrdmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-fhlrdmp","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治脱肛日久，服药未验，复下赤白脓痢，作里急后重，白多赤少，不任其苦：御米壳（去蒂萼，蜜炒）、橘皮各五分，干姜（炮）六分，诃子（煨，去核）七分。上为细末，都作一服，水二盏，煎至一盏，和渣空心热服。（《兰室秘藏》诃子皮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-y6zbb59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-y6zbb59","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治肠风泻血：诃黎勒十个（酒润，草纸裹，煨熟，肉与核共捣细），白芷、防风、秦艽各-两。俱微炒，研为末，米糊丸，梧桐子大.每早晚各服三钱，白汤下。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-pryq20y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-pryq20y","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治白带白淫，因虚寒者：诃黎勒十个（酒润，草纸裹，煨熟，内与核共捣细），白术、黄芪、当归、杜仲、蛇床子、北五味子、山茱萸肉各二两。俱炒研为末，炼蜜丸，梧桐子大。每早服三钱，白汤下。（《医林集要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-7poxi9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-7poxi9u","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治老人气虚不能收摄，小水频行，缓放即自遗下，或涕泪频来，或口涎不收：诃黎勒，不用煨制，取肉，时时干嚼化，徐徐含咽。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ajia7iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ajia7iv","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治口疮经久不愈：诃黎勒五个（酒润，草纸裹煨熟，肉与核共捣细），好冰片一分。共研匀细，不时掺入少许，口含徐徐咽下。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-74e7rf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-74e7rf4","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-02wmivq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-02wmivq","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗大叶性肺炎"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-wm63fbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-wm63fbc","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取诃子肉5钱，瓜蒌5钱，百部3钱，为1日量，水煎分两次服。临床观察20例，多数均能在1～3天内退热，3～6天内白细胞下降至正常，6～11天内炎症吸收，未发现不良副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-8okgfcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-8okgfcr","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗细菌性痢疼"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-pii7ant","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-pii7ant","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用20％诃子液作保留灌肠，每日2次，每次10～40毫升；同时口服诃子肠溶胶囊，每日3～4次，每次1粒，饭前两小时服，症状好转后剂量减半，再服3～4次。临床治疗25例，23例痊愈，其中体温恢复正常平均为2.4天，腹泻及粪便性状明显好转平均为2.8天，大便恢复正常、腹痛及里急后重消失平均为2.9天。除个别服药有恶心外，其他无不良反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-cful9x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-cful9x2","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗白喉带菌者"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vz60i56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vz60i56","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服10％诃子煎液，每天3～4次，每次约100～150毫升。局部可用煎液含漱，每天4～5次；或用蒸过的诃子含咽，每天4～5次，每次1～2粒；亦可用50％煎液喷射鼻腔及咽喉部，每天1次。临床观察20例（其中1例中途加用他药治疗），服药后经连续3次以上喉拭培养均为阴性。用药时间最短4天，最长17天，平均为6.9天。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-l43xjid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-l43xjid","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-cupu1qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-cupu1qh","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"诃子，同乌梅、五倍子用，则收敛；同橘皮、厚朴用，则下气；同人参用，则能补肺治咳嗽。东垣云，嗽药不用者，非矣，但咳嗽未久者不可骤用尔。嵇含《草木状》言作饮久服，令髭发白者变黑，亦取其涩也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ygrezlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ygrezlv","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"诃黎勒其味苦涩，其气温而无毒。苦所以泄，涩所以收，温所以通，惟敛故能主冷气，心腹胀满；惟温故下食。甄权用以止水道，萧炳用以止肠澼久泄，苏颂用以疗肠风泻血、带下，朱震亨用以实大肠，无非苦涩收敛，治标之功也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-p1km46n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-p1km46n","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药品化义》：\"诃子能降能收，兼得其善，盖金空则鸣，肺气为火邪郁遏，以致吼喘咳嗽，或至声哑，用此烽火敛肺，则肺窍无壅塞，声音清亮矣。取其涩可去脱，若久泻久痢，则实邪去而元气脱，用此同健脾之药，固涩大肠，泻痢自止。但苦能泄气，真气太虚者，宜少用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-g3sltff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-g3sltff","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sugn2im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sugn2im","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 其变种植物恒河诃子亦同供药用。与上种的主要区别点为：植物的枝、叶、花序及子房均密被白色柔毛；花序及花较密集；果实较小，被毛。广西有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-e4nv4va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-e4nv4va","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上植物的叶（诃子叶）、幼果（藏青果）、果核（诃子核）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-fqx3bcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-fqx3bcm","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-tmq8qot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-tmq8qot","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nc15h7k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nc15h7k","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：诃子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-v3r0d1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-v3r0d1y","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-u6vow93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-u6vow93","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hē Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-6ilzf8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-6ilzf8y","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-cn2xfw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-cn2xfw6","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 诃黎勒、诃黎、诃梨、随风子"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-oqtp4l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-oqtp4l2","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-y61ke3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-y61ke3t","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Medicine Terminalia Fruit, Fruit of medicine Terminalia"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-2kc5qzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-2kc5qzf","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-3gjmx0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-3gjmx0o","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草图经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-r24pe1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-r24pe1t","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使勿用毗梨勒、罨梨勒、榔精勒、杂路勒。若诃黎，文只有六路，或多或少，并是杂路勒。毗梨勒，个个毗；杂路勒皆圆露文；或八路至十三路，号日榔精勒，多涩不入用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-z2hblu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-z2hblu3","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：诃黎勒，今岭南皆有，而广州最盛。七、八月实熟时采，六路者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-hn27ehg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-hn27ehg","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-umbq0ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-umbq0ya","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为使君子科植物诃子微毛诃子的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-0zuuml8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-0zuuml8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Terminalia chebula Retz.2.Terminalia chebula Retz. Var. tomentella (Kurz.)C. B. Clarke"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-wf82799","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-wf82799","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋末冬初果实成熟时，选晴天采摘。采收的成熟果实，晒干或烘干即市辖区化材诃子。采收未木质化的幼果，放入水中烫2-3min后，取出晒干即为藏青果。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-o02c15v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-o02c15v","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-qh63jqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-qh63jqc","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔800-1800,的疏林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-7so88y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-7so88y8","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于海拔800-1100m的阳坡、林缘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-fswghe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-fswghe2","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于云南西部和西南部，广东，广西有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-eajs7vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-eajs7vm","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布于云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-pbrdmtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-pbrdmtu","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-x8ke5d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-x8ke5d5","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 乔木，高达30m。枝近无毛，皮孔细长，白色或淡黄色，幼枝黄褐色，被绒毛。叶互生或近对生；叶柄粗壮，长1.8-2.3cm，距顶端1-5mm处有2（-4）腺体；叶往卵形或椭圆形，长7-14cm，宽4.5-8.5cm，先端短尖，基部钝圆或楔形，偏斜，全缘或微波状，两面无毛，密被细瘤点；穗状花序腋生或顶生，有时又组成圆锥花序；花两性；花萼管杯状，淡绿带黄色，长约3.5mm，5齿裂，长约1mm，三角形，外面无毛，内面被黄棕色的柔毛；花瓣缺；雄蕊10，高出花萼之上，花药小，椭圆形；子房下位，1室，圆柱形，长约1mm，被毛，干时变黑褐色，花柱长而粗，锥尖。核果，卵形或椭圆形，长2.4-4.5cm，径1.9-2.3cm，青色，粗糙，无毛，成熟时变黑褐色，通常有5条钝棱。花期5月，果期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-azn5bmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-azn5bmy","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本变种与诃子的区别在于：幼枝、幼叶全被铜色平伏长柔毛；苞片长过于花；花萼外无毛；果卵形，长不足2.5cm。花期6-8月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-zmr4kqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-zmr4kqf","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-p79cckc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-p79cckc","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜高温润气候。耐旱、耐霜。喜阳光充足。多生于海拔950-1850m之间，云南滇西北纬24左右地带，为诃子的主产区。年雨量在1000-1500mm左右。对土壤要求不甚严格，但宜选疏松肥沃、排水良好的壤土栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-he51uk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-he51uk7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子和嫁接繁殖。种子育苗移栽：4-10月播种。播种前用锤子等器具打破内果皮，取出种仁，用清水浸泡48h，在苗床上按行株距30m×15m开沟点播，覆土3cm。育苗1年，按行株距6m×3m开穴定植。嫁接繁殖：用芽接法，选株高1m左右的实生苗作砧木，用优良母树的枝条作接穗，在雨季树皮易剥离时进行芽接。育成的苗在秋季落叶后或早春未发芽前移栽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nf8acva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nf8acva","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 定植后头3年，结合中耕除划，分别于春季或秋季追肥各1次。进行摘顶、整枝、整形，使树冠均匀生长。结果树在采果的及时追肥1次，以促进开花及恢复树势。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-za097bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-za097bq","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 病害有立枯病，在苗期易发生。播种前苗床用70%五氯硝基苯粉剂消毒土壤；发病初期用1：1：140的波尔多液喷雾防治。虫害有褐天牛，培训班食树干造成枯枝或全株死亡。发生期可用棉花蘸浸敌敌畏200倍液塞虫孔毒杀幼虫。诃子瘤蚜，用90%敌百虫800倍液喷杀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4l8dbnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4l8dbnp","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-1sj4wpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-1sj4wpp","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 果产呈长圆形或卵圆形，长2-4cm，直径2-2.5cm。表面黄棕色或暗棕色，略具光泽，有5-6条纵棱线及不规则的皱纹，基部有圆形果梗痕。质坚实。果肉厚0.2-0.4cm，黄棕以或黄褐色。果核长1.5-2.5cm，直径1-1.5cm，浅黄色，粗糙，坚硬。种子狭长纺锤形，长约1cm，直径0.2-0.4cm；种皮黄棕色，子叶2。折色，相互重叠卷旋。气微，味酸涩后甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-dhcrkd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-dhcrkd1","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以肉厚、技坚，、表面黄棕色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4v5eren","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4v5eren","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 果皮横切面；外果皮为5-8列厚壁细胞，细胞内含棕色物。中果皮由薄壁组织、厚壁细胞环及维管束等组成。薄壁细胞圆形，在外果皮内侧与索状组织之间有2-5层薄壁细胞，细胞直径30-50（-110）μm，色浅黄，壁较厚，细胞内有棕色树脂团块（遇氯化高巩试液呈黑色（及较大油滴。厚壁细胞环由多数纤维状厚壁细胞纵横交错构成，多切向延长，细胞长70-130（-365）μm，直径5-20μm。维管束多为不规则走向，有时分枝，近外果皮的导管直径7-20μm，以孔纹较常见；近果核的导管直径可达60μm。散布于近导管的薄壁细胞含草酸钙簇晶，直径30-80μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-dejf58r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-dejf58r","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xsgv7xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xsgv7xc","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 柯子素对小鼠LD50为500mg/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vbv1a64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vbv1a64","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-s8kk6kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-s8kk6kk","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 诃子的果实含鞣质23.60%-37.36%[1]，内含：诃子酸（chebulinic acid),诃黎勒酸（chebulgaic acid)，鞣料云实精（corilagin)，诃子鞣质（terchebulin)，2，3-O-连二没食子酰石榴皮鞣质（punicalagin)，榄仁黄素（terflavin)A，原诃子酸（terchebin)，葡萄糖没食子鞣甙（glucogallin)，1，3，6-三没食子酰葡萄糖（1，2，3，4，6-pentagalloyl-β-glucose)，没食子酸（gallic acid)，并没食子酸（ellagic acid)[2,3]等。又含三萜类成分：榄仁萜酸（ter-minoic acid)，诃王醇（chebupentol)[4]。还含莽草酸（shikimic acid)，去氢莽草酸（dehydroshikimic acid)，奎宁酸（quinic acid)[5]，三十碳酸（triacontanoic acid)，棕榈酸（palmitic acid)，没食子酸已酯（ethylgallate)，诃子次酸三已酯（triethyl chebulate)，胡萝卜甙（darcos-terol)，β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol)[6]，阿拉伯糖（arabinose)，果糖（fruc-tose)葡萄糖（dextrose)，蔗糖（sucrose)，鼠李糖（rhamnose(和氨基酸（aminoacids)[5]等。另含番泻甙（sennoside)A[7]，诃子素（chebulin)[8]以及鞣酸酶（tannase)，多酚氧化酶（polyhenolox-idase)，过氧化物酶（peroxydase)，抗坏血酸氧化酶（ascorbic acid oxidase)[9]等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ozpdetm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ozpdetm","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-x2fuyib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-x2fuyib","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗菌作用：体外试验证明，对4-5种痢疾杆菌都有效，尤以诃子壳为佳。诃子水煎剂（100%）除对各种痢疾杆菌有效外，且对绿脓杆菌、白喉杆菌作用较强，对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌、肺炎球菌、溶血性链球菌、变形杆菌、鼠伤寒杆菌亦有作用（纸片法）；对痢疾杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌的有效浓度分别为1：32，1：128，1：64（试管法）。诃子在体外有良好的抗伤寒杆菌的作用。用盐酸、乙醚提取的乙醇提取物具有更高的抗菌及抗真菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-hzz7mty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-hzz7mty","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗肿瘤实验：。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-myjtdue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-myjtdue","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.经诃子水煎液处理之小鼠恶性肿瘤（腹水癌、梭形细胞肉瘤）细胞、接种于小鼠体内，将失其生活能力。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-5ldwcps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-5ldwcps","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.分别接种于艾氏腹水癌。中国小鼠腹水肉瘤、梭形细胞肉瘤之小鼠，经口服诃子煎液后，其所产之腹水或肿瘤之重量，均较对照组为少。诃子对小鼠艾氏腹水癌，中国小鼠腹水肉瘤，梭形细胞肉瘤的生长，具有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-m6ncf1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-m6ncf1c","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对活性氧的清除和对抗十四酰基佛手醇乙酯（TPA）对人白细胞DNA的损伤的影响：诃子醇提物10-20μg/ml显着抑制（P＜0.01）Fe2+／维生素C诱发的小鼠肝、肺匀浆和线粒体的脂质过氧化，诃子水提物200-400μg/ml才有抑制作用。诃子醇提物25μg/ml明显清除核黄素（VB2）+光产生的O2-和对抗H2O2引起的溶血，诃子水提物100μg/ml才有一定对抗作用。诃子醇提物20μg/ml显着抑制TPA20μg/ml诱发的人白细胞化学发光，50μg/ml明显对抗TPA100ng/ml和香烟烟雾凝集物（CSC）400μg/ml引起的人白细胞DNA断链。诃子水提物用至400μg/ml不能对抗同剂量TPA引起的人白细胞DNA断链。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sk860uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sk860uy","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其他作用：从干果中用80%乙醇提得的诃子素，对平滑肌有罂粟碱样的解痉作用；除鞣质外还含有致泻成分，故与大黄相似，先致泻而后收敛。含诃子的中药复方曾报告有某些抗癌效果。同属植物Terminalia belenica的果实的醇提取物有促进胆汁分泌、降压、抑制平滑肌的作用。其种子仁中所含之油与蓖麻油相似，对小鼠有泻下作用，水解产物（与蓖麻油相似）也有刺激作用，毒性不大。诃子不同炮制品对离体兔肠自发性活动和乙酰胆碱及氯化钡引起的肠肌收缩无有明显的抑制和拮抗作用，各炮制品之间未见明显差异；诃子核加大剂量可与带核诃子得到同样结果。诃子各炮制对蓖麻油所致小鼠腹泻皆有较好的止泻作用，各炮制品间无明显差异，但对小鼠小肠输送机能的抑制作用，麸煨诃子略强。总之，诃子炮制后，鞣质含量增高，对离体兔肠收缩有明显的抑制作用，对小鼠腹泻有较好的止泻作用。但纯鞣酸质不能使兔离体肠管松弛，而是肠管收缩。用诃子水煎剂（100%）除对痢疾杆菌有效外，对绿脓杆菌、白喉杆菌作用较强，对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌、肺炎球菌、溶血性链球菌、变形杆菌，鼠伤寒杆菌亦有作用；对痢疾杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌的有效浓度分别为1：32，1：128，1：64。诃子提取物对流感有灭活作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-1f2rha3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-1f2rha3","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-zdyaupx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-zdyaupx","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.诃子肉：用锤打开诃子果皮，除去果核即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-qef57u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-qef57u5","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.炒诃子：清水洗净，晒干，入锅内用武火炒至表面深黄色为度，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4ezo3ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4ezo3ml","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vi5cf37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vi5cf37","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 取本品粉末3g，加水30ml，浸泡3h，滤过。取滤液2ml，加三氯化铁试液1滴，发生深蓝色沉淀；另取滤液2ml，加明胶试液1滴，发生白色沉淀。（示鞣质反应）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sym0dbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sym0dbd","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-ixcp0ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-ixcp0ve","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺；大肠；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-50z4nok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-50z4nok","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-1d2uzfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-1d2uzfy","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；酸；涩；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gsarayd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gsarayd","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-y5mtk5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-y5mtk5e","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.凡外邪未解，内有湿热火邪者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4oqk00m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4oqk00m","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《品汇精要》：气虚人忌多服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-0gnvt8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-0gnvt8h","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《医学入门》：气虚及暴嗽、初泻，不可轻用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-2jj40da","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-2jj40da","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草经疏》：咳嗽因于肺有实热，泄泻因于湿热所致，气喘因于火热冲上，带下因于虚热而不因于虚寒，及肠僻初发，湿热正盛，小便不禁因于肾家虚火，法并忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-h8s888u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-h8s888u","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.本草求真》：虚人不宜独用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-vrx0ie4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-vrx0ie4","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-62jeq0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-62jeq0j","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 敛肺；涩肠；下气；利咽。主久泻；久痢；脱肛；喘咳痰嗽；久咳失音"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-nzvsrd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-nzvsrd3","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-kdytofx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-kdytofx","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-6g；或入丸、散。敛肺清火宜生用，涩肠止泻宜煨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-km8diji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-km8diji","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-gglknuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-gglknuv","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 敛肺利咽者生用；涩肠止泻者煨之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-4q9799p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-4q9799p","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-wkjln0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-wkjln0i","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：诃黎勒其味苦涩，其气温而无毒。苦所以泄，涩所以收，温所以通，惟敛故能主冷气，心腹胀满；惟温故下食。甄权用以止水道，萧炳用以止肠僻久泄，苏颂用以疗肠风泻血、带下，朱震亨用以实大肠，无非苦涩收敛，治标之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-r84l2gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-r84l2gn","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《药品化义》：诃子能降能收，兼得其善，盖金空则鸣，肺气为火邪郁遏，以致吼喘咳嗽，或至声哑，用此降火敛肺，则肺窍无壅塞，声音清亮矣。取其涩可去脱，若久泻久痢，则实邪去而元气脱，用此同健脾之药，固涩大肠，泻痢自止。但苦能泄气，真气太虚者，宜少用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-93p8rj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-93p8rj7","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：诃子，苦涩降敛，生用清金止嗽，煨熟固脾止泻，古方取苦以化痰涎，涩以固滑泄也。殊不知降敛之性，虽云涩能固脱，终非甘温益脾之比。然此仅可施之于久嗽喘乏，真气未艾者，庶有劫截之能。又久嗽阴火上炎，久痢虚热下迫，愈劫愈滞，岂特风寒暴嗽、湿热下痢为禁剂乎？。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-5oraln4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-5oraln4","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《长沙药解》：《金匮》诃黎勒散治气利，以肝脾郁陷，二气凝塞，木郁风动，疏泄失藏而为下利，利则气阻而痛涩，是为气利；诃黎勒行结滞而收滑脱也。肠滑而为利者，清气滞塞而不收也；肺逆而为咳者，浊气壅塞而不敛也；诃黎勒苦善泄而酸善纳，苦以破其壅滞，使上无所格而下无所碍，酸以益其收敛，使逆者自降而陷者自升，是以咳利俱止也。其治胸满心痛、气喘痰阻者，皆破奎降逆之力；其治崩中、带下、便血、堕胎者，皆疏郁升陷之功也。5.《南方草木状》：可作饮，变白髭发令黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-sk1r5er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-sk1r5er","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药性论》：通利津液，主破胸膈结气，止水道，黑髭发。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-tc22csi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-tc22csi","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《唐本草》：主冷气心腹胀满，下宿物。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xsh0ze0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xsh0ze0","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《海药本草》：主五膈气结，心腹虚痛，赤白诸痢及呕吐咳嗽，并宜使皮，其主嗽。肉炙治眼涩痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-z54woj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-z54woj4","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《日华子本草》：消痰，下气，除烦，治水，调中，止泻痢，霍乱，奔豚肾气，肺气喘急，消食开胃，肠风泻血，崩中带下，五膈气。怀孕未足月漏胎及胎动欲生，胀闷气喘。并患痢人后分急痛，产后阴痛，和蜡烧熏及热煎汤熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-7kh2cky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-7kh2cky","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草图经》：治痰嗽咽喉不利，含三数枚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-iup3ng9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-iup3ng9","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草通玄》：生用则能清金行气，煨用则能暖胃固肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xc56yvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xc56yvs","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614094117-xuvh73h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094117-xuvh73h","updated":"20240614094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094118-ys0v1uj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094118-ys0v1uj"}},{"ID":"20240614094119-f01s6rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094119-f01s6rj"}}]}